    <div class="pl-heading"><span data-copy="m1eyebrow">Moment 1 of 6 · HQ preparation</span><h2 data-copy="m1title">One curriculum. Several ways to learn.</h2><p data-copy="m1body">HQ prepared one fictional Robotics Explorers package. Every format shares the same objectives and evidence task.</p></div>
    <div class="pl-grid two"><article class="pl-card"><small>PACKAGE v1.0 · MTR-01</small><h3 data-copy="module">Turn, test, explain</h3><ul><li data-copy="objective1">Predict clockwise and counterclockwise movement.</li><li data-copy="objective2">Distinguish partial turns from complete rotations.</li><li data-copy="objective3">Transfer the idea to a new starting position.</li><li data-copy="objective4">Explain or demonstrate the result.</li></ul><p class="pl-info" data-copy="clarified">Clarified shaft-end view, facing the motor. Two complete clockwise rotations = 720°.</p></article>
      <article class="pl-card"><h3 data-copy="formats">Prepared teaching formats</h3><div class="pl-format-grid"><div><b data-copy="video">Video / storyboard</b><span data-copy="workingStoryboard">Working prepared storyboard</span></div><div><b data-copy="audio">Audio / narration</b><span data-copy="simNarration">Simulated media · script and transcript</span></div><div><b data-copy="animation">Animation / interactive</b><span data-copy="workingLab">Working keyboard-accessible motor lab</span></div><div><b data-copy="text">Text</b><span data-copy="workingBrief">Working concise brief and extension</span></div></div><p data-copy="noMedia">No media was recorded or generated live.</p></article></div>
    <button class="pl-primary" type="button" data-action="make-available" data-copy="makeAvailable">Make available to centers</button>
