    <div class="pl-grid two"><article class="pl-card"><h3 data-copy="assessmentWorks">How assessment works</h3><div class="pl-info"><b data-copy="newStudent">New student</b><p data-copy="newStudentBody">Brief fictional questions establish current knowledge, interests, preferred ways to begin, and support needs.</p></div><div class="pl-info blue"><b data-copy="existingStudent">Existing student</b><p data-copy="existingStudentBody">Prepared prior responses add evidence without replacing new observations.</p></div></article>
      <article class="pl-card"><small>ROBERT · ASSESSMENT-1</small><dl class="pl-assessment"><div><dt data-copy="knowledge">Current knowledge</dt><dd data-copy="knowledgeBody">Identifies clockwise and counterclockwise from the shaft-end view.</dd></div><div><dt data-copy="skills">Skills</dt><dd data-copy="skillsBody">Predicts quarter-turn endpoints and revises after visible feedback.</dd></div><div><dt data-copy="preference">Presentation preference</dt><dd data-copy="preferenceBody">Currently engages most readily when he can try the controls.</dd></div><div><dt data-copy="interests">Interests</dt><dd data-copy="interestsBody">Rescue missions, robots, and testing a prediction.</dd></div><div><dt data-copy="support">Support need</dt><dd data-copy="supportBody">Counting complete rotations needs one concise example before independent practice.</dd></div></dl></article></div>
    <article class="pl-card"><h3 data-copy="evidenceUsed">Evidence used</h3><div class="pl-grid three"><p data-copy="source1">New-student intake · fictional questions</p><p data-copy="source2">Prepared prior evidence · Sep 8 · supported revision</p><p data-copy="source3">Prepared prior evidence · Sep 15 · direction correct; full-turn count uncertain</p></div></article>
    <div class="pl-grid two"><article class="pl-card"><small data-copy="reportingSetup">REPORTING SETUP · SEPTEMBER CYCLE</small><h3 data-copy="deadlineTitle">Reports due September 30 at 5:00 PM</h3><p data-copy="deadlineBody">The presenter starts preparation explicitly. No background scheduler runs.</p><dl class="pl-assessment"><div><dt data-copy="policyTitle">Center approval policy</dt><dd data-copy="policyBody">After Coach review, reports that meet every displayed check are approved automatically. Uncertain or failed checks are held for Center review.</dd></div><div><dt data-copy="inspection">Manual inspection</dt><dd data-copy="inspectionBody">Center staff can inspect either outcome and all prior versions.</dd></div></dl></article><article class="pl-card"><small data-copy="languagePreferences">SUPPORTED LANGUAGE PREFERENCES</small><h3 data-copy="languageTitle">Each person keeps an independent preference.</h3><dl class="pl-assessment"><div><dt>Robert</dt><dd data-copy="robertLanguage">Learning content · English</dd></div><div><dt data-copy="robertFamily">Robert’s Family</dt><dd data-copy="familyLanguage">Progress report · Spanish</dd></div></dl><p class="pl-muted" data-copy="languageLimit">This walkthrough supports English and Spanish only. The page menu controls the current presentation.</p></article></div>
