    <div class="pl-grid two"><article class="pl-card"><small data-copy="watchExample">Working example · animation with captions</small><h3 data-copy="countExample">Count one full turn, then one half-turn.</h3><div class="motor" data-motor><span class="motor-label top">Top</span><span class="motor-label right">Right</span><span class="motor-label bottom">Bottom</span><span class="motor-label left">Left</span><span class="needle"></span><i></i></div><p class="pl-caption" data-animation-caption data-copy="readyAnimation">Ready. The marker starts at Top.</p><div class="pl-actions compact"><button type="button" data-action="play" data-copy="play">Play example</button><button type="button" data-action="replay" data-copy="replay">Replay</button></div><p data-copy="exampleResult">1 complete turn + ½ turn = 1½ turns. The marker ends at Bottom.</p><p class="pl-muted" data-copy="silent">Silent local animation. No audio was recorded or generated.</p></article>
      <article class="pl-card"><small data-copy="yourTurn">Now you try · prepared challenge</small><h3 data-copy="challenge">Start at Top. Predict the endpoint after 1¼ clockwise turns.</h3><fieldset><legend data-copy="where">Where will the marker stop?</legend><div class="pl-choices"><button type="button" data-position="Top">1 · Top</button><button type="button" data-position="Right">2 · Right</button><button type="button" data-position="Bottom">3 · Bottom</button><button type="button" data-position="Left">4 · Left</button></div></fieldset><label for="pl-explanation" data-copy="howCount">How did you count? (optional practice note)</label><textarea id="pl-explanation" rows="3" data-copy-placeholder="explainPlaceholder" placeholder="Explain how you counted the turns…"></textarea><div class="pl-actions"><button class="pl-primary" type="button" data-action="run" data-copy="run">Run the motor</button><button type="button" data-action="hint" data-copy="hint">Show me a hint</button></div><div class="pl-feedback" data-feedback hidden></div></article></div>
    <details class="pl-card"><summary data-copy="alternatives">Try another explanation</summary><p data-copy="alternativeBody">These working alternatives do not change Marcus’s saved recommendation.</p><div class="pl-actions compact"><button type="button" data-alternative="animated" data-copy="animatedDemo">Animated demonstration</button><button type="button" data-alternative="illustrated" data-copy="illustrated">Step-by-step illustrated</button><button type="button" data-alternative="written" data-copy="written">Concise written explanation</button></div><div class="pl-alternative" data-alternative-panel hidden></div></details>
